Sounds good! FYI, if you use CODEX for targeted sequencing, it’s recommended that you run the entire genome altogether rather than chr by chr, since there aren’t as many targets compared to whole exome sequencing. The current segmentation is performed within each gene.

Feel free to use CODEX for your thesis! You can simply cite our paper published in Nucleic Acids Research.

Cheers,
